msgid "Unknown application"
msgstr "Rhaglen anhysbys"

msgid "No AT-SPI-exposed shortcuts found for this application.\nGTK app? Try Ctrl+? — many bind their own shortcuts window to it."
msgstr "Ni chanfuwyd unrhyw fyrlwybrau a ddatgelwyd gan AT-SPI ar gyfer y rhaglen hon.\nRhaglen GTK? Rhowch gynnig ar Ctrl+? — mae llawer yn clymu eu ffenestr fyrlwybrau eu hun wrtho."
